# Root-level env reference — see apps/web/.env.example and services/local-agent/.env.example
# for the actual per-app files. This file documents the split only.

# apps/web (Next.js, deployed to Vercel):
#   PUBLIC:  NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL, NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
#   NEVER PUBLIC: SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY must not be used in apps/web at all.

# services/local-agent (Python, runs on your machine only):
#   SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY (server-side sync, local process only)
#   GMAIL_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID, GMAIL_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET
#   GEMINI_API_KEY (optional)
#   Statement passwords are NEVER stored in any .env file — see docs/security.md.
